   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "In this scene, Max sprints to the bar and accuses bartender Kostya of betraying him to the prosecutor. To Max's immense relief, it turns out the scary customer was only asking for directions to the restroom. Listen to the conversation in Russian first, and then we will examine every line.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
